Welcome to Huldra.

The root file system lives on the IDE disk (ext2 on /dev/hda); files you
create here survive reboots. Documentation and examples are in
/usr/share/huldra (see /usr/share/huldra/README).

  help              shell commands
  startgui          the graphical session (startgui tilewm for tiling)
  hack              break into a security terminal (a word game)
  mines, blocks     minesweeper and falling blocks (in the graphical session)
  pkg update        then pkg search / pkg install cowsay fortune 2048 sl snake
